      {
        "__struct_id": 9,
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": "To be used with The Krit's fixes for the CEP adaptation of Demigog's \"2nd Edition Style\" demilich.\r\n\r\nThis placeable represents a resting demilich and should not be used outside the demilich scripts.\r\n\r\nThis is the placeable that used to be usable as a resting demilich, but that is no longer the case. However, Pile of Bones that were placed under CEP 2.0 -- and not updated -- will function as expected. (This placeable can be made to function as the older placeables by giving it zep_demi_bone_hb as a heartbeat function, but this is not recommended.)\r\n\r\nSee the demilich creature comments for more details.\r\n"
        }
